  "prefLabel": "Ed 1123.20 Appeal of Decision of Hearing Officer",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 1123.20 Appeal of Decision of Hearing Officer.\n\n(a) Any party aggrieved by a final decision of the hearing officer in a hearing may appeal that decision to a court of competent jurisdiction in accordance with 34 CFR 300.516(a).\n\n(b) Parties aggrieved by the findings and final decision of the hearing officer in a due process hearing may bring a civil action under 34 CFR 300.516(a).\n\nSource. (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Ed 1100) #9197, eff 6-28-08; ss by #12141, eff 3-24-17",
